{
  "slug": "plex-ui",
  "name": "Plex Ui",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Teach your AI agent the Plex UI component library — subpath imports, unified size scale (3xs–3xl), semantic colors, dark mode via light-dark(), and 460+ icons. Works with 35+ components (Button, Input, Select, Sidebar, Menu, Dialog, Tabs, DatePicker, and more), 14 hooks, and 460+ icon subpath imports. Auto-invokes when your project imports from @plexui/ui.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `plex-ui` (Manages Plex UI components and projects — installing, composing, styling, and debugging UI).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install plex-ui@claude-community` from `plex-ui/docs` (`skills/plexui`).\n\nTeach your AI agent the Plex UI component library — subpath imports, unified size scale (3xs–3xl), semantic colors, dark mode via light-dark(), and 460+ icons. Works with 35+ components (Button, Input, Select, Sidebar, Menu, Dialog, Tabs, DatePicker, and more), 14 hooks, and 460+ icon subpath imports. Auto-invokes when your project imports from @plexui/ui.",
